---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Arrow from '../../components/Arrow.astro';
const groups=[
 {id:'ordering',title:'Quotes & ordering',items:[
  {question:'What is the minimum order quantity?',answer:'Orders start at 1 piece. Include your first-order quantity and expected repeat quantities so the quotation can distinguish prototype work from future batches.',href:'/resources/prototype-vs-small-batch-cnc/',label:'Planning prototypes and repeat batches'},
  {question:'What is the production lead time?',answer:'Production takes 7–14 business days after drawing and order confirmation, including surface finishing. Shipping time is additional. Record the confirmed production schedule and delivery arrangements in your quotation and order.',href:'/resources/how-we-work/',label:'How to order'},
  {question:'What should I send for a quotation?',answer:'Send the drawing revision, units, material grade, finish, quantity and delivery destination. Include a STEP model where available and a dimensioned 2D drawing identifying critical tolerances, threads and acceptance requirements.',href:'/resources/rfq-checklist/',label:'Drawing and RFQ checklist'},
  {question:'Does the website send my inquiry or upload my drawing?',answer:'No. The inquiry form prepares an email draft. Check the draft, open it in your email application, attach your drawings and send it there. Copy and download options are also available; preparing a draft does not send an inquiry to LZZ.',href:'/quote/',label:'Prepare an inquiry'},
 ]},
 {id:'engineering',title:'Processes & specifications',items:[
  {question:'Which machining services can I discuss with LZZ?',answer:'Our five service areas are CNC milling, CNC turning, five-axis CNC machining, plastic machining and casting machining. Share the complete part geometry so the route, workholding and finishing requirements can be reviewed together. For castings, agree who supplies and approves the blank.',href:'/capabilities/',label:'Explore the five machining services'},
  {question:'How should I specify the material and finish?',answer:'Specify the exact material grade and condition, not just aluminum, steel or plastic. Identify cosmetic faces, surface treatment requirements, masking and dimensions that must be checked after finishing. The quotation should record the agreed specification.',href:'/resources/material-and-finish-checklist/',label:'Material and finish guide'},
  {question:'Can every feature hold ±0.01 mm?',answer:'No. ±0.01 mm is a conditional engineering reference for selected critical features after review, not a general part tolerance or guarantee. Material, geometry, setup and measurement method determine whether it applies. Identify each critical feature on the drawing for confirmation.',href:'/quality/',label:'Tolerance review and quality control'},
 ]},
 {id:'quality-delivery',title:'Inspection & delivery',items:[
  {question:'Which inspection documents should I request?',answer:'Specify the required dimensional results, first-article records, material traceability and finishing documents before ordering. Agree the features, sampling and report format. The quotation records the included document package and any additional cost; request current calibration evidence separately where needed.',href:'/quality/#order-documentation',label:'Inspection and delivery documents'},
  {question:'Is LZZ ISO 9001 certified?',answer:'LZZ is ISO 9001 certified. For supplier qualification, request the current certificate for Hangzhou Lizhizao Precision Machinery Co., Ltd., including its number, issuer, validity, scope and verification details. Company awards are separate from the ISO certificate, and quality-system certification does not replace part-specific acceptance or industry approval.',href:'/quality/#quality-management',label:'Request supplier qualification documents'},
  {question:'How are packing and international shipping agreed?',answer:'Provide the destination, receiving requirements and any vulnerable or cosmetic surfaces that need protection. Confirm the packing method, transport method, trade term and named place in the quotation. Agree the packing list, commercial invoice and other required documents. Transit time is separate from production time.',href:'/resources/custom-cnc-parts-shipping-checklist/',label:'Shipment planning checklist'},
  {question:'What do the machining case studies demonstrate?',answer:'The studies use original LZZ workshop photographs to discuss visible part features, machining sequences and drawing questions. They are not customer performance reports, inspection results or proof of a particular delivery outcome.',href:'/cases/',label:'Browse machining case studies'},
 ]},
];

const quoteHref='/quote/?'+new URLSearchParams({part:'Custom CNC machining — FAQ follow-up'}).toString();
const quoteInputs=['Drawing revision and units','Exact material grade and condition','Finish and surface treatment','First-order and expected repeat quantities','Delivery destination','STEP model, where available','Dimensioned 2D drawing with critical tolerances, threads and acceptance requirements'];
const resources=[['RFQ checklist','What to prepare for a quotation','/resources/rfq-checklist/'],['Material & finish guide','Grades, conditions and finishes','/resources/material-and-finish-checklist/'],['Quality control','Inspection and documentation','/quality/'],['Shipping checklist','Packing and delivery requirements','/resources/custom-cnc-parts-shipping-checklist/'],['Machining studies','Workshop examples and process notes','/cases/'],['Back to Resources','More technical resources','/resources/']];
---
<Layout title="CNC Machining FAQ" cta={false}>
 <article class="fq-page">
  <header class="fq-wrap fq-hero">
   <div class="fq-intro"><nav class="fq-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/resources/">Resources</a><span>/</span><span>Frequently asked questions</span></nav>
    <h1>Custom CNC<br/>machining FAQ</h1><p class="fq-lead">What to send for a quote, how production time is counted, and which inspection and shipping details to agree before ordering.</p>
    <nav class="fq-topics" aria-label="FAQ topics">{groups.map(group=><a href={'#'+group.id}>{group.title}<Arrow size={16}/></a>)}</nav>
   </div>
   <dl class="fq-quick"><div><dt>Minimum order</dt><dd>From 1 piece</dd><p>Share first-order and expected repeat quantities for separate quotes.</p></div><div><dt>Production</dt><dd>7–14 business days</dd><p>After drawing and order confirmation, including surface finishing. Shipping time is additional.</p></div><div><dt>To quote</dt><dd>Drawing + specifications</dd><p>Send drawing revision, units, material, finish, quantity and destination.</p></div></dl>
  </header>
  <section class="fq-wrap fq-section" id="ordering" aria-labelledby="ordering-title"><h2 id="ordering-title">Quotes &amp; ordering</h2>
   {groups[0].items.slice(0,2).map((item,index)=><div class="fq-row" id={'ordering-'+(index+1)}><span class="fq-number" aria-hidden="true">{String(index+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><h3>{item.question}</h3><p>{item.answer}</p></div>)}
  </section>
  <section class="fq-wrap fq-section fq-preparing" aria-labelledby="preparing-title"><h2 id="preparing-title">Preparing a quotation</h2><div class="fq-prepare-grid">
   <div class="fq-inputs" id="ordering-3"><span class="fq-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3>{groups[0].items[2].question}</h3><div><p>Please provide the following information:</p><ul>{quoteInputs.map(input=><li>{input}</li>)}</ul></div></div>
   <div class="fq-draft" id="ordering-4"><span class="fq-number" aria-hidden="true">04</span><div><h3>{groups[0].items[3].question}</h3><p>{groups[0].items[3].answer}</p><a class="fq-primary" href={quoteHref}>Prepare RFQ email <Arrow size={17}/></a></div></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="fq-wrap fq-section" id="engineering" aria-labelledby="engineering-title"><h2 id="engineering-title">Processes &amp; specifications</h2>
   {groups[1].items.map((item,index)=><div class="fq-row" id={'engineering-'+(index+1)}><span class="fq-number" aria-hidden="true">{String(index+5).padStart(2,'0')}</span><h3>{item.question}</h3><p>{item.answer}</p></div>)}
  </section>
  <section class="fq-band" id="quality-delivery" aria-labelledby="quality-delivery-title"><div class="fq-wrap fq-section"><h2 id="quality-delivery-title">Inspection &amp; delivery</h2>
   {groups[2].items.slice(0,3).map((item,index)=><div class="fq-row" id={'quality-delivery-'+(index+1)}><span class="fq-number" aria-hidden="true">{String(index+8).padStart(2,'0')}</span><h3>{item.question}</h3><p>{item.answer}</p></div>)}
  </div></section>
  <section class="fq-wrap fq-section fq-case" aria-labelledby="case-title"><h2 id="case-title">Case studies &amp; further resources</h2><div class="fq-row" id="quality-delivery-4"><span class="fq-number" aria-hidden="true">11</span><h3>{groups[2].items[3].question}</h3><p>{groups[2].items[3].answer}</p></div>
   <div class="fq-resources"><h3>Helpful resources</h3><nav aria-label="Helpful resources">{resources.map(([title,description,href])=><a href={href}><div><strong>{title}</strong><span>{description}</span></div><Arrow size={17}/></a>)}</nav></div>
   <div class="fq-further"><a href={groups[0].items[0].href}>Prototypes and repeat batches <Arrow size={15}/></a><a href={groups[0].items[1].href}>How to order <Arrow size={15}/></a><a href="/capabilities/">Explore machining services <Arrow size={15}/></a><a href="/quality/#quality-management">Supplier qualification <Arrow size={15}/></a></div>
  </section>
 </article>
</Layout>
<style>
 .fq-page{--fq-blue:#07558b;--fq-line:#d9dfe4;background:#fff;color:#191f27}.fq-page .fq-wrap{width:calc(100% - 128px);max-width:1280px;margin-inline:auto}.fq-page h1,.fq-page h2,.fq-page h3{margin:0;line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.035em;font-weight:600;text-wrap:initial}.fq-page p{margin:0;font-size:20px;line-height:1.55;color:#444d56}.fq-page a{text-decoration:none}.fq-page a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--fq-blue);outline-offset:4px}.fq-page [id]{scroll-margin-top:110px}.fq-page .fq-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.85fr 1fr;gap:68px;padding-block:56px 50px}.fq-breadcrumb{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:14px;color:#525c65;margin-bottom:25px}.fq-breadcrumb a:hover{color:var(--fq-blue)}.fq-page h1{font-size:clamp(44px,5.3vw,76px);line-height:1.03;letter-spacing:-.045em}.fq-page .fq-subtitle{font-size:34px;line-height:1.25;color:#222c39;margin-top:18px;letter-spacing:-.025em}.fq-page .fq-lead{max-width:62ch;margin-top:16px;font-size:19px}.fq-topics{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px 30px;margin-top:30px}.fq-topics a{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;border-bottom:1px solid #07558b;min-height:44px;color:var(--fq-blue);font-size:15px;font-weight:550}.fq-quick{margin:10px 0 0;border-left:1px solid var(--fq-line);padding-left:52px}.fq-quick>div{padding-block:21px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--fq-line)}.fq-quick>div:first-child{padding-top:0}.fq-quick>div:last-child{border:0;padding-bottom:0}.fq-quick dt{font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none;font-weight:550}.fq-quick dd{margin:0;color:var(--fq-blue);font-size:29px;font-weight:550;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-.025em}.fq-page .fq-quick p{font-size:15px;margin-top:10px;line-height:1.5}.fq-section{padding-block:20px}.fq-page h2{font-size:42px;margin-bottom:16px}.fq-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px minmax(0,.9fr) minmax(0,1.65fr);gap:22px;padding-block:24px;border-top:1px solid var(--fq-line)}.fq-number{font-size:27px;color:var(--fq-blue);line-height:1.25;font-weight:550;letter-spacing:-.03em}.fq-page h3{font-size:28px;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-.025em}.fq-row h3{max-width:25ch}.fq-row p{max-width:67ch}.fq-prepare-grid{border-top:1px solid var(--fq-line);padding-top:24px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.65fr .95fr;gap:36px}.fq-inputs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px .9fr 1.45fr;gap:22px}.fq-page .fq-inputs p,.fq-inputs li{font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#444d56}.fq-inputs ul{padding-left:20px;margin:6px 0 0}.fq-inputs li{margin:4px 0}.fq-inputs li::marker{color:var(--fq-blue)}.fq-draft{display:grid;grid-template-columns:45px 1fr;gap:20px;border-left:1px solid var(--fq-line);padding-left:30px}.fq-page .fq-draft h3{font-size:21px}.fq-page .fq-draft p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin-top:14px}.fq-page .fq-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;min-height:48px;background:#cf0618;color:#fff;border-radius:2px;padding:12px 20px;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;margin-top:18px}.fq-primary:hover{background:#ac0010}.fq-preparing{padding-bottom:36px}.fq-band{background:#f0f2f4;margin-top:8px}.fq-band .fq-section{padding-block:28px 12px}.fq-case{padding-top:28px}.fq-resources{display:grid;grid-template-columns:170px 1fr;gap:25px;padding-block:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--fq-line)}.fq-page .fq-resources h3{font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0;margin-top:10px}.fq-resources nav{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px 20px}.fq-resources a{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;min-height:64px;padding:10px 14px;border-left:1px solid var(--fq-line);color:var(--fq-blue)}.fq-resources a:hover,.fq-further a:hover{border-color:var(--fq-blue);background:#f5f8fa}.fq-resources strong{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4}.fq-resources span{display:block;color:#56606a;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:3px}.fq-further{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding-bottom:14px}.fq-further a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;font-size:13px;color:var(--fq-blue);border:1px solid var(--fq-line);padding:8px 12px;min-height:40px}
 @media(max-width:1100px){.fq-page .fq-wrap{width:calc(100% - 64px)}.fq-page .fq-hero{gap:36px;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr}.fq-quick{padding-left:28px}.fq-quick dd{font-size:26px}.fq-page .fq-subtitle{font-size:28px}.fq-row{grid-template-columns:46px 1fr 1.5fr;gap:18px}.fq-page h3{font-size:22px}.fq-prepare-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}.fq-inputs{grid-template-columns:46px 1fr 1.5fr;gap:18px}.fq-draft{grid-template-columns:46px 1fr;border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--fq-line);padding:24px 0 0;gap:18px}.fq-draft>div{max-width:70ch}.fq-resources{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}}
 @media(max-width:760px){.fq-page .fq-wrap{width:calc(100% - 40px)}.fq-page .fq-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px;padding-block:28px}.fq-breadcrumb{font-size:12px;gap:8px;margin-bottom:24px}.fq-page h1{font-size:46px}.fq-page .fq-subtitle{font-size:25px;margin-top:14px}.fq-page .fq-lead{font-size:17px}.fq-topics{gap:8px 20px;margin-top:22px}.fq-topics a{font-size:14px}.fq-quick{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--fq-line);padding:20px 0 0;margin:0}.fq-quick>div{padding-block:16px}.fq-quick dd{font-size:25px}.fq-page h2{font-size:29px;margin-bottom:18px}.fq-section{padding-block:20px}.fq-row{grid-template-columns:36px 1fr;gap:10px 14px;padding-block:22px}.fq-row p{grid-column:2;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}.fq-page h3{font-size:21px}.fq-number{font-size:23px}.fq-inputs{grid-template-columns:36px 1fr;gap:10px 14px}.fq-inputs>div{grid-column:2}.fq-draft{grid-template-columns:36px 1fr;gap:14px}.fq-page .fq-draft h3{font-size:21px}.fq-page .fq-draft p{font-size:16px}.fq-prepare-grid{padding-top:22px}.fq-page .fq-primary{font-size:15px;padding-inline:16px}.fq-resources nav{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}.fq-resources a{min-height:66px}.fq-further{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}.fq-further a{min-height:44px}.fq-band .fq-section{padding-block:26px 8px}.fq-page :global(svg){flex-shrink:0}}
</style>
